{"resourceIdentifier":"4508","resourceName":"Weibei Pipeline Associated Gas Recovery Project","description":"Weibei Pipeline Associated Gas Recovery Project is located in Beihai City, GuangXi Zhuang Autonomous Region, P.R. China. The project activity involves newly building processing and transport system, recover the associated gas produced by Weizhou offshore oilfield exploitation and send it to mainland for utilization. After the project put into production, it is expected to process average 210 million Nm 3 associated gas annually. In the absence of the project, the associated gas produced in the offshore oilfield would be flared to the atmosphere. The baseline scenario of the project is the same as the scenario existing prior to the start of implementation of the project. By recovering the associated gas, greenhouse gas (GHG) emission reductions will be generated by utilization of the recovered gas which displaces the use of other fossil fuel sources. It is expected to reduce an average amount of 423,049 tCO2e annually.","location":{"latitude":21.050000,"longitude":109.080000},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2023-08-29","endExclusive":"2023-09-29","endInclusive":"2023-09-28"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"4508"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Guangxi"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"CNOOC China Limited, Zhanjiang Branch"},{"type":"string","value":"Guangdong, China"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"354152"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Fugitive emissions from fuels (solid, oil and gas)"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"AM0009"}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values"